{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65870,"id":"03c4523667a342f5"}||{"x":100,"y":850,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":12,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:GPIO35/36/37由八线PSRAM占用。\nGPIO19/20专用于原生USB，不复用为普通IO。\n所有执行器的默认关闭依靠外部偏置。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65871,"id":"a27d5d1ee8b74eab"}||{"x":1140,"y":305,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":12,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:下载口改用第1页Type-C，J3五针排针已删除。\nGPIO19=D−，GPIO20=D+；各串22Ω，靠近模组。\nUSB Serial/JTAG支持烧录、日志和双向命令。\n固件须启用USB控制台及命令处理，不能只开日志输出。\n必要时按住BOOT，再按下并释放RESET，最后释放BOOT。\nGPIO43/44预留未连接，目标业务UART保持独立。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
