{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65872,"id":"ae053f96a9d44ee8"}||{"x":100,"y":980,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"电路解析｜控制与采集核心","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65873,"id":"54b41e2101404039"}||{"x":100,"y":948,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:16MB Flash + 8MB 八线 PSRAM；通过Wi-Fi或原生USB接收控制。\nGPIO4～8：五路按键；GPIO11/12：真实电池 / 外部电源。\nGPIO13：充电开关；GPIO14/15：目标串口 TX / RX。\nGPIO9/10：I2C；GPIO18：电流告警；GPIO38：预留未连接；TX禁用改由GPIO14输入态实现。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65874,"id":"4da2b8d0a6844fef"}||{"x":1140,"y":1120,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"复位","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65875,"id":"cbce8bcd4bfb4f5a"}||{"x":1140,"y":1088,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:SW1（C455243）按下将EN接地复位；\nR5 / C7 保留上拉与RC延时。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65876,"id":"0894e9d7b1ba4cbc"}||{"x":1740,"y":1120,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"下载启动","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65877,"id":"3af1f8053b4c42cd"}||{"x":1740,"y":1088,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:SW2（C455243）按下将GPIO0接地；\n按住BOOT后复位，进入下载模式。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65878,"id":"03a6ab786b2d40c1"}||{"x":1140,"y":500,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"配置按键","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65879,"id":"06cca57d396e4f3c"}||{"x":1140,"y":468,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:SW3（C455243）按下将GPIO17接地；\nCONFIG为独立业务输入，动作含义由固件定义。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65880,"id":"421d6bac34654286"}||{"x":100,"y":260,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"供电与总线","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65881,"id":"f3fa74ca925e4a26"}||{"x":100,"y":228,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"22µF 储能配合 100nF 高频去耦；应靠近模组供电脚。\nR81 / R82 为 SDA / SCL 提供 4.7kΩ上拉，供两个 ADC 共用。\nI2C 使用 3.3V 电平：INA228 地址 0x40，ADS1115 地址 0x48。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65882,"id":"0cead849169d41b8"}||{"x":1740,"y":230,"rotation":0,"color":"#236278","fontSize":16,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"启动与指示","fillColor":"#236278","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":65883,"id":"2f2ae62fb057478c"}||{"x":1740,"y":198,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","fontSize":14,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"AI:GPIO46用10kΩ下拉；状态LED由GPIO16控制。\n下载与日志走原生USB；目标业务UART保持独立。","fillColor":"#444444","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
